			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				31,
				0
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Update Mountain, Rest, and Worker submodules to latest versions\n\nThis commit synchronizes critical Land submodules to their latest versions, ensuring alignment with ongoing development and maintenance efforts:\n\n1. **Mountain** (9afa88d → ffa9a7d): Updates to latest commit introducing native file operation optimizations through enhanced River/Sun crate integration, improving filesystem read/write performance in the Tauri backend.\n\n2. **Rest** (03c9451 → 84e1830): Bumps version to include updated VS Code platform bundling configurations, ensuring compatibility with Cocoon's extension host through refined esbuild optimization passes.\n\n3. **Worker** (47e3c1e → ccbaa07): Incorporates service worker enhancements for better CSS loading performance in Sky's UI layer, leveraging modernized Workbox configurations.\n\nThese updates maintain Land's architectural integrity by ensuring tight coordination between native backend components (Mountain), build tooling (Rest), and UI runtime infrastructure (Worker), while preserving strict separation of concerns across the Rust/TypeScript boundary.\n\nRefs #106 #344 #320",
			"SHA": "14bda57cc37bed334485538395130d0d278e5bb9"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-08-13T17:39:22Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				31,
				0
			],
			"Message": "Merge branch 'Current' of ssh://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Element into Current",
			"SHA": "8547e49cf19deeb0dd69c20af17d3fc1ddf6ba43"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-08-13T17:39:20Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				0,
				0
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Update dependencies across Land ecosystem submodules\n\nThis commit synchronizes development and production dependencies across multiple Land submodules to maintain security, compatibility, and tooling consistency:\n\n1. **Cocoon & Wind**: Bump `@effect/opentelemetry` from 0.56.1 to 0.56.2 (semver-patch) to align with latest Effect-TS ecosystem improvements.\n2. **Common**: Update `@cloudflare/workers-types` from 4.20250812.0 to 4.20250813.0 (semver-minor) for enhanced Cloudflare Workers integration.\n3. **Echo**: Bump Cloudflare toolchain dependencies including `wrangler` (4.28.1→4.29.0), `@cloudflare/workers-types` (same as Common), and `miniflare` (4.20250803.0→4.20250803.1).\n4. **Sky**: Upgrade `vite` from 7.1.1 to 7.1.2 (semver-patch) for improved build reliability.\n\nAll updates follow semver compatibility guarantees and maintain Land's architectural principles of strict dependency separation and resource efficiency. No breaking changes introduced.\n\nRefs #106 #186 #344 #346 #320 #161",
			"SHA": "0c88083ec7e2220f42730ed44ba65302333c5ce7"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Auto",
			"Date": "2025-08-13T00:59:25Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				31,
				0
			],
			"Message": "",
			"SHA": "6aa6ce24a06cba3bddf68c079a19f75bd02958a2"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-08-12T22:50:33Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				31,
				0
			],
			"Message": "",
			"SHA": "b7bf18225d6cb11c57eb82ebf44980e1bb539466"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-08-12T20:54:58Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				31,
				0
			],
			"Message": "chore(SideCar): Update submodule to include Node.js v24.5.0/v22.18.0 binaries\n\nThis commit updates the SideCar submodule to incorporate the latest pre-compiled Node.js runtimes, aligning with Tauri's cross-platform requirements and Land's strict separation between native backend components (Mountain) and runtime dependencies.\n\nThe update synchronizes with SideCar's recent improvements (commit 4bc0cccbeeab0d8ffe04ea2a6aa36bd6fdfdcc40) that add Node.js v24.5.0 and v22.18.0 binaries for aarch64-apple-darwin and x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu targets. This ensures compatibility with Mountain's runtime selection logic in build.rs while maintaining resource efficiency through optimized binary bundling.\n\nThis change enhances cross-platform support for Cocoon's extension host without introducing breaking changes, following semver compatibility guarantees for runtime dependencies.",
			"SHA": "5da9997bf8ee0b10be833aeafce98d1e531bd46e"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-08-12T20:49:03Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				31,
				0
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Update dependencies across Land ecosystem and refine SideCar binary management\n\nThis commit synchronizes dependencies across multiple Land submodules and improves binary management infrastructure:\n\n1. **Dependency Updates**:\n   - Upgrades Effect-TS ecosystem packages (@effect/*) to latest patch/minor versions in Cocoon, Wind, and Common\n   - Updates GitHub Actions dependencies (actions/checkout 4.2.2→5.0.0, actions/cache) across all submodules\n   - Modernizes Node.js type definitions (@types/node 24.2.0→24.2.1) in relevant components\n\n2. **SideCar Improvements**:\n   - Cleans obsolete executables and LFS rules\n   - Adds Node.js v24.5.0/v22.18.0 binaries for cross-platform support\n   - Streamlines Cache.json for current runtime versions\n\n3. **Tooling Consistency**:\n   - Aligns version control configurations across submodules\n   - Removes redundant metadata files (.DS_Store, debug executables)\n\nThese changes enhance security posture, reduce maintenance overhead, and ensure compatibility with Tauri's cross-platform requirements while maintaining strict separation between Mountain's native backend and runtime dependencies.\n\nNo breaking changes introduced - all updates follow semver compatibility guarantees.",
			"SHA": "5d169cdaba80227eb0dd3d5cd2aef5210c62e906"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-08-12T20:35:33Z",
